      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: Hello, friend from the future. Please do not close this book.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: To think it would get a reaction so soon. I ought to write something
        quickly, before the person on the other side decides to leave.
