      value: Santi
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.character
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -4258627021580615586, guid: 7c50abb68975940c9a305e1136732385, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linksToOtherDialogue
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: It was the Polar Still, the CWS and UFNA got into a fight over something
        here in Giyala.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: "(Change the future\u2026 end this suffering our people have been forced
        to go through for decades\u2026)"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: (Can I really pull off something like that?)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: "(This is all too confusing, and frankly suspicious\u2026 but on the
        off chance that I can really make a difference, I just need to try.)"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: "(I\u2019ll have to hide this book, but if I can learn more about what
        happened in the past, there might just be an opening for me to do something.)"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[5]'
      value: What can I do?
